sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports ISO15118-20
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: Authorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: EVConnectedPreSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: ISO15118SmartCharging (iso15118-20)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, maxScheduleTuples = 3, requestedEnergyTransfer = AC_BPT, controlMode = DynamicControl, departureTime = <Current DateTime + 2 hours>, evTargetEnergyRequest = 1000)
    Note right of CS: chargingNeeds.availableEnergyTransfer [AC_single_phase, AC_three_phase, AC_BPT]<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxChargePower 5000<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxDischargePower 5000
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted or Processing
    Note over CS,CSMS: If NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse status was Processing,<br>the Test System will wait 60 seconds for the request
    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile<br>transactionId must be <Provided transactionId from before><br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[0].chargingSchedulePeriod[0].setpoint must be <Not omitted>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingSchedule = <ChargingSchedule provided at step 3>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, maxScheduleTuples = 3, requestedEnergyTransfer = AC_BPT, controlMode = DynamicControl, departureTime = <Current DateTime + 3 hours>, evTargetEnergyRequest = 1000)
    Note right of CS: chargingNeeds.availableEnergyTransfer [AC_single_phase, AC_three_phase, AC_BPT]<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxChargePower 5000<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxDischargePower 5000
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted or Processing
    Note over CS,CSMS: If NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse status was Processing,<br>the Test System will wait 60 seconds for the request
    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile<br>transactionId must be <Provided transactionId from before>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingSchedule = <ChargingSchedule provided at step 5>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, maxScheduleTuples = 3, requestedEnergyTransfer = AC_BPT, controlMode = DynamicControl, departureTime = <Current DateTime + 3 hours>, evTargetEnergyRequest = 3000)
    Note right of CS: chargingNeeds.availableEnergyTransfer [AC_single_phase, AC_three_phase, AC_BPT]<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxChargePower 5000<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxDischargePower 5000
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted or Processing
    Note over CS,CSMS: If NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse status was Processing,<br>the Test System will wait 60 seconds for the request
    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile<br>transactionId must be <Provided transactionId from before>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingSchedule = <ChargingSchedule provided at step 5>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
